Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "So this is what Hyrule looked like when
Twilight invaded it... Fascinating.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "With the land covered as it is, I can't really
pinpoint the Gate of Souls. Always something...",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Careful! We can hardly see the enemy
through these blasted shadows!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Eeek! I'm in big trouble!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "I just heard someone screaming!
We've got to go check it out!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Aieee! Can anyone hear me?!
Someone, help!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "We'll be right there! Just hold on for a
minute!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Be on alert! The darkness is crawling with
monsters!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Ohhh... This is not good!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Get to the village, quickly! Before it's
too late!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "We need that girl's help to get through the
Twilight... Protect her with your life!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Mister Butterfly says we should go this way!
C'mon! We mustn't be tardy!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "The doors are locked... But that's
no problem! I can handle this!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Tee hee! A pair of termites once taught
me that little door-opening trick!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Mister Butterfly is getting scared... I think
the darkness in this keep needs to go!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "If we defeat this big baddie, then Mister
Butterfly can keep flying ahead!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Aww, Mister Butterfly is happy now!
Look--he's leading us again!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Those monsters are up to something... They
might be trying to sneak into our base!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "I'll take care of that black witch!
Underlings! Hold them back!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Oh no! Mister Butterfly, come back! That
angry cat just drove Mister Butterfly away!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "I'll get the butterfly back. Agitha, you need
to get back to the village for now.",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Well, OK... Please keep Mister Butterfly safe!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Do I hear some mangy stray caterwauling
about me? Then maybe it needs a playmate!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Why don't you go in my stead and give
that...ugh, thing...a taste of fun?",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Things are getting chaotic out here! Take the
enemy keeps and stop the reinforcements!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Our base is under attack! We need
someone to defend it!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Welcome to a time of Twilight! But, so
sorry, I don't have time to play with you!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "THERE! Found you! Dispel the curse you
placed on me before I claw out your eyes!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Are you kidding?! She escaped because
you got in my way! Are you on her side?!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Wait! We're not enemies! I just came to
get that butterfly back!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Hush! I'm in no mood to talk about insects!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Fine. I didn't want to fight you, but I need
that butterfly and I don't have time to talk.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Man, she's a lot stronger than I thought!
I don't think I can take her in a fair fight...",
  "1.0.38.0" => "I'm a lot stronger when I'm within Twilight.
Just one of the perks of being a Twili.",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Wait--did you create the shadow here?
Because it's spawning monsters everywhere!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Created? Hah! You don't realize it, but you're
talking to Princess Midna of the Twili people!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Maybe if I can take the Twilight keeps,
her power will weaken...",
  "1.0.42.0" => "I simply couldn't sit around doing nothing!
I'm going to get Mister Butterfly back now!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Dang it, I told her to stay in the village. Ugh,
fine. I can't leave her alone out there.",
  "1.0.45.0" => "What? Where'd my power go? Is someone
closing off patches of Twilight?",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Aha, I knew it! Shutting down sources
of Twilight makes her a pushover!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "So the Twilight's all gone, is it?
Aren't you clever...?",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Great. I've got no choice but to withdraw
for now. I just need a few minutes...",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Capture the kitty! She still has Mister
Butterfly!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Why can't you just leave me alone? Ugh.
Fine! If you want a fight, let's do this!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "I've been completely beaten. All right then,
do your worst to me...",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Urgh... I never thought I'd get beaten while
I still had access to the Twilight's power...",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Oh, Miss Kitty, please? Pretty please, can
you give back Mister Butterfly?",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Fine, take the butterfly, but... Wait.
You're not with the witch?",
  "1.0.55.0" => "No. Completely the opposite. We're heading
to the Gate of Souls to try to stop her.",
  "1.0.56.0" => "You should have led with that! She and
I still have some unfinished business.",
  "1.0.58.0" => "The Allied Base has fallen?
Then we've lost...",
  "1.0.59.0" => "I...can't move...",
  "1.0.60.0" => "No... I couldn't save her... Forgive me.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "This ouchie is a bit bigger than I can
handle...",
  "1.0.62.0" => "How could I let her fall...? Forgive me!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Hey, out of my way! I've got business
with that witch!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Don't you look cute! Well, I must be off.
Let's pick this up some other time. Tah!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "I feel like I've been stepped on...",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Oh no! Please help me!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "So, you've chased me all the way here? Fine.
It'd be rude of me not to play with you then!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Central Keep appears to have opened.
Seems suspicious... Be careful!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "It's hard to fight with this Twilight covering
us... We have to get rid of it somehow!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Why is this monster all shadowy? Maybe it's
the one responsible for the Twilight!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Aha! Capturing a keep in the Twilight clears
it right up! That's good to know!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "I guess that means we've got some keeps
to capture!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "I'm not handing this butterfly over without
a fight. Someone, keep that girl at bay!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Don't worry, Agitha. I'll get your butterfly
back. You just wait in the village, OK?",
  "1.0.75.0" => "Oh, that's so kind of you! OK, I'll wait
right there.",
  "1.0.76.0" => "I'm still lacking a bit of something...
Increase the Twilight's power!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "The more Twilight that spreads across the
battlefield, the stronger she gets!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "I think we should stop that mean enemy
headed for the keep then!",
  "1.0.79.0" => "Hooray! We can finally rest a little bit!",
  "1.0.80.0" => "Phew... Hopefully this'll get the enemy
to chill out for a while.",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Leave the rest to us! You just worry
about heading back to the village!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "Umm... About that... You see, Mister
Butterfly seems to be missing...",
  "13.0.2.0" => "I think we're without a choice. We'll have
to force her to give back Mister Butterfly!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Miss Kitten is so much stronger than she looks!
Please, oh, please be careful, everyone!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "The interior of the keep is also covered in
darkness... Is it part of the Twilight, too?",
  "13.0.5.0" => "This monster looks different... Maybe
defeating it will disperse the Twilight!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "The Gate of Souls... Where is it?",
  "13.0.7.0" => "You hear that? I can hear a girl's voice
calling for help! We have to investigate!",
}